  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#table-charref-overrides\n\n> Append the Unicode character with code point equal to the character reference code to the temporary buffer\n\nHello,\nshouldn't the above line read: \"Clear the temporary buffer and append the Unicode character with code point equal to the character reference code\" ? other wise _12.2.4.75 Character reference end state_ emits as char tokens/appends to attribute value **all** characters in the buffer - including \"&\", \"#\" and possibly \"x\" or \"X\"\n",
